1
00:00:00,400 --> 00:00:04,147
In September twenty thirteen, a speedrunner named DOTA

2
00:00:04,168 --> 00:00:06,650
TeaBag was racing through the Tick Tock Clock

3
00:00:06,500 --> 00:00:09,310
level of Super Mario Sixty-Four.

4
00:00:09,160 --> 00:00:12,000
Without touching a single button to jump, his

5
00:00:11,850 --> 00:00:16,040
